                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A short, free horror click and point adventure game with a decent atmosphere. I must say, I'm surprised about all of those negative reviews here! Especially because many of those are wrong. \r\nMany people complain about no jumpscares in this game: wrong, there are two in total! Not the most scariest ones I've ever seen, but they are still there. \r\nThen people complain about the bad english here, but obviously the developer's native language isn't english! So if you aren't happy with that kind of language option then pick out another one (like you would really try to learn a different kind of language, but expecting from a foreigner to learn yours perfectly!).\r\n Unfortunately this game got some bugs, but you can save your progress anytime, so that's no big lose. And I even found a Cthulhu reference here in this game. \r\nSo if you want to kill a hour wtih a free game, then give it a try. I can't say it was the most intriguing one I've ever played, but it definetely doesn't deserve so many negative reviews!!",
